Implement dynamic resize for plugin GUI on Linux/macOS.

Plugin window should support host-initiated resize and user-initiated
resize on Linux and macOS platforms.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Plugin GUI resizes when host sends resize request
- [ ] User can drag plugin window edges to resize (if host supports it)
- [ ] Layout recalculates on resize (no clipping or overlap)
- [ ] Minimum size enforced
- [ ] Works on Linux (X11) and macOS (Cocoa)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Load plugin in REAPER on Linux, resize, verify layout adapts
- [ ] Load plugin in a macOS host, resize, verify layout adapts
- [ ] Resize to minimum, verify no layout breakage
